&Q000453
1.	Shrine of @wSN{Nibru}, shrine surpassing the @fsux{abzu}, shining @wTN{E-kur}; 
2.	your prince is the Great Mountain @wDN{Enlil} who surpasses the Prince @noteref{i.e. @wDN{Enki}}. Your great lady is the good woman, 
3.	Mother @wDN{Ninlil}, excelling in refinement. 
4.	Your caretaker is one whose vigour is surpassing, 
5.	the hero @wDN{Ninurta}. 
6.	The chief minister @noteref{i.e. @wDN{Nuska}}, who is worthy of your fair copper vessels, 
7.	who makes your bedchamber exceedingly pleasant, 
8.	is also the guardian watching over your honourable divine powers; 
9.	he is the shepherd watching over your honourable divine powers. 
10.	Your provider, 
11.	who was engendered by the Great Mountain and was born by @wDN{Ninlil} -- @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}, 
12.	who was engendered by the Great Mountain, 
13.	and was born by @wDN{Ninlil}, 
14.	he who has achieved a high reputation among his numerous people, 
15.	throws himself at your feet. 
11.	@wSN{Nibru}, your praise suits the mouth! May it be uttered by every mouth! 
12.	The @wDN{Anuna} gods always stand by your truthful utterances. Shrine @wSN{Nibru}, 
13.	primeval city, where the divine powers are allotted, 
14.	sweet is your praise! 
15.	At the great festivals prepared with care in @wSN{Nibru}, 
16.	all the great gods …… the majesty of @wDN{Enlil} and @wDN{Ninlil}. 
17.	@fsux{Sa-gida}. 
